 (text "Universal LCC / CAN Interface Rev C" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 95 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8))))
(text "Rev C: passive diagnostics - D2 power LED (via R4), D3 TX LED (via R5), D4 RX LED (via R6), all 1k; probe pads TP4-6 (board-only) on +3V3/CAN_TX/CAN_RX." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))))
(text "RJ45 pin 3 CAN_GND and pin 6 share CAN_GND net; shell (SH) also on CAN_GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))))
(text "PWR_NEG remains separate. Bus power is pass-through only. Local ground = CAN_GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))))
(text "R2/R3 = DNP mode pulldowns: fit only for TCAN330/334/337 (pins 5/8 = mode ctrl). TCAN332 leaves them NC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100 155 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))))
